p.src:
Differentiating gives the mean excitation energy: $\begin{aligned}
 E_{\rm exc}
 &=-\frac{\partial\log Z_{\rm exc}}{\partial\beta}
  =-\frac{1}{Z_{\rm exc}}
    \frac{\partial Z_{\rm exc}}{\partial\beta}
 \notag\\
 &=\hbar\omega\,
   \frac{e^{-\beta\hbar\omega}}
        {1-e^{-\beta\hbar\omega}}
  =\frac{\hbar\omega}{e^{\beta\hbar\omega}-1}.
 \end{aligned}$

